cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ADROIT, please cite it using the metadata below, together with the codes and data releases your results used (see the README)."
type: software
title: "ADROIT: the Agentic Dark matter Reinterpretation and Operator Inference Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  ADROIT is a toolkit for reinterpreting dark matter searches and inferring the
  interactions behind them. It computes direct-detection limits and signal fits
  for any non-relativistic operator, judges thermal-relic models against
  collider, astrophysical, cosmological and direct-detection constraints, and
  builds any freeze-out model from its Lagrangian. Language-model agents propose
  models, plans and inputs; deterministic code checks every proposal before it
  reaches a result.
authors:
